    {
      "kind": "addition",
      "subject": "na",
      "rationale": "Potšišo ye Sepedi e e nyakago, Seheberu se e hloka — e ngwalwa ka dipotšišo fela."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Gomme a mo bolelela: O bolela bjalo ka e tee ya basadi ba bosenyi. Ge re amogela ⟨את⟩ se sebotse go tšwa go ⟨את⟩ Elohim, na re se amogele ⟨את⟩ gomme se se boŠwego? Go sebakanyi se ka moka Ayobo ga a bege sebe ka molomo wa gagwe.",
